      {
       "text": "Recently we have released a Patch & New Content Roadmap indicating the next steps in reaching the stars of perfection.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Though it suggested an extensive Project Overhaul update, we involved our engineers who, incentivized by players' additional feedback, also took care of supplementary corrections.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As the result, we have a bigger and more advanced update, including fixes and improvements, that we want to introduce today!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
