       "text": "• Localized AI: Spoken texts by AI voice are now available in multiple languages instead of just English (adjustable via settings menu)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved System Placing: Players can now place multiple systems of the same kind in succession on the ASL grid",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Adjusted interest rates for banks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Decreased atmosphere needs for HCA and CAB workforce modules",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Decreased workforce requirement for unlocking LPI research project from 600 to 550",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
